      "text": "Repository development practice: AGENTS.md instructs contributors to write the failing test first, capture Red via `bun run rgr -- red --strict`, change production code only after Red, then run green, refactor, and `verify --ci --replay` before handoff, and to use `rgr revise-test` rather than editing protected Red tests."
    },
