  "summary": "rgr is described as a no-dependency Red-Green-Refactor gate for coding agents that records the failing test first, freezes it with hashes and snapshots, and refuses Green or Refactor if the Red test was edited. The CLI exposes subcommands including init, red, green, refactor, verify, revise-test, status, doctor, inspect-test, prompt, and lock-intent, invoked via Bun with flags like --goal-id, --test, --protect, --ci, --replay.",
  "superseded_claim_ids": []
